{
  "$schema": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/nobrega8/mbmap-library/main/schema/mbmap-2.schema.json",
  "mbmap": 2,
  "vendor": "Alfa Instrumentos",
  "model": "6620",
  "vendor_website": "alfainstrumentos.com.br",
  "description": "Bulk dosing system (Dosadora a Granel) with Modbus TCP",
  "revision": 1,
  "revised": "2026-11-11",
  "source": "Alfa Instrumentos, Manual de Configuração e Operação, Dosadora a Granel Mod. 6620 (0140MN00), section 23.1 Dados em Modbus TCP",
  "sources": [
    {
      "title": "Manual de Configuração e Operação - Dosadora a Granel Mod. 6620",
      "version": "0140MN00",
      "note": "Section 23.1 and the status and fault tables of section 22.5; supplied with the map request"
    }
  ],
  "notes": [
    "Modbus TCP on port 502; the data block is 16 registers from 4096 (function 0x03), as figure 130 of the manual shows.",
    "The manual says the 32-bit values are two words, Lo then Hi (4096 weight Lo, 4097 weight Hi), so the word order is little.",
    "The weights are integers in kg whose decimals are set on the weighing channel; the manual's example (40 shown as 4.0 kg, 1060 as 106.0 kg) has one decimal, so a scale of 0.1 is used. Change it if the channel is set to another number of decimals.",
    "Register 4110 holds the status bits and 4111 the faults, as in the tables of section 22.5. Bits 9 to 14 of the status and 11 to 15 of the faults are reserved.",
    "The date and time registers hold the day, month, year (four digits in the example), hour, minute and second of the selected record.",
    "The manual's tables are partly low-resolution scans; the register numbers were read from figure 130 and confirmed against the text."
  ],
  "protocol": "tcp",
  "port": 502,
  "unit_id": 1,
  "byte_order": "big",
  "word_order": "little",
  "address_base": 0,
  "x_status": "official",
  "registers": [
